    <h2>Linking Threats to Business Risk</h2>

    <p>PASTA stands for Process for Attack Simulation and Threat Analysis. Where STRIDE is a technical checklist applied to components, PASTA is a risk-centric methodology that starts from business objectives and works down to technical threats.</p>

    <table class="content-table">
        <thead>
            <tr>
                <th>Stage</th>
