        </svg>
    </div>

    <div class="success-box">
        <h4><i class="fas fa-lightbulb"></i> Key Point</h4>
        <p>The cheapest path for the attacker is not always the one with the fewest boxes. It is the path with the fewest AND conditions the attacker must satisfy at once.</p>
    </div>
</div>
